  "title": "Jefferson County — the money trail",
  "year": 2026,
  "grand_total": 39595853.4,
  "note": "This is the county's 2026 appropriation ordinance (No. 2026-92) as filed with the state. It lists one amount for each General Fund office and for each other fund. The ordinance also moves $9,224,629.79 between county funds (Article III), so some dollars may appear in both the fund that sends them and the fund that spends them."
